<blockquote>
<p>SCP-5359 designates a group of buildings in ████, USA. SCP-5359 consists of seven (7) buildings designated SCP-5359-01 through -07. A circular stone clearing with a 30 meter circumference is in the center of the building. Each of these buildings has a different anomalous property as listed below.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Deleted at -14 and three votes.</p>
<hr />
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-5311 Class: Euclid is a 9 year old girl who loves to make paintings. She is 4'3 in height and weighs 153lb. The girl has short black hair and a white dress down to her knees. She has 2 beaded bracelets on her right arm that are also white. Not to mention the fact that she has incredibly bad hearing and will have to resort to reading things off of a piece of paper when communicating with others. She is very sensitive to high pitched sounds. She has no known name and researchers has not found any info about her past yet.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Deleted at -14 and three votes.</p>
<hr />
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-5215 is a two-floor 15m x 10m wooden motel in the Malian part of Sahara Desert near the town of ██████. When a human being makes eye contact with the building, SCP-5215 becomes active. The human subject starts hearing their dead friends’ or relatives’ voices calling them from inside the motel. This attracts the human to enter although it is up to them to do so. There is no way to access the 2nd floor, what lies there is still a mystery. Inside, there are four seats, two doors and a counter. In the left door there is a small room with a chair which has limbless body with no inferior jaw and eyes.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Deleted at -13 and three votes.</p>
